'''Prank Spinner''' (Japanese: '''いたずらルーレット''' ''Prank Roulette'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

